{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>לעלם ועד.</b> It is a term of everlasting, and the vav in it is a root letter — therefore it is open [with a patach]. But ״אָנֹכִי הַיּוֹדֵעַ וָעֵד״ (Jeremiah 29), in which the vav is a connective [letter], is closed [with a shuruk]."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:52:30.077906575Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}